# Extension Build Workflow

## After making extension changes

**Always repackage** when you edit extension code. Do not skip this step.

1. **Bump version** in `extension/package.json` (e.g. 0.1.10 → 0.1.11) — avoids cache issues when testing
2. **Run** `cd extension && npm run package` — compiles and produces `yms-zendoc-X.X.X.vsix`

The .vsix is in `extension/`. AirDrop or install it to test on another machine.
